simal automorphisms", "target_term": "无穷小自同构"}, {"source_term": "group", "target_term": "群"}, {"source_term": "kernel", "target_term": "核"}, {"source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "sets", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "Formal Deformation Theory", "target_term": "形式形变理论"}, {"source_term": "Formal Deformation Theory", "target_term": "形式形变理论"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "algebra map", "target_term": "代数映射"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "trivial deformation", "target_term": "平凡形变"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节讨论第<REF_0001>节中引入的切空间概念的一种推广。\n为妥善进行这一讨论，我们借用形式形变理论（Formal Deformation Theory）第<REF_0002>、<REF_0003>和<REF_0004>节中的一些记号。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为<MATH_0003>上的群胚纤维化范畴（category fibred in groupoids）。\n给定一个同态（homomorphism）<MATH_0004>（在<MATH_0005>-代数（algebras）之间），以及一个对象（object）<MATH_0006>，它属于<MATH_0007>且位于<MATH_0008>之上，我们用<MATH_0009>表示范畴（category），其对象为<MATH_0010>到<MATH_0011>的提升。\n<MATH_0012>的一个对象（object）是一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0013>，它属于<MATH_0014>且位于<MATH_0015>之上，而<MATH_0016>的态射（morphisms）定义为交换图（commutative diagrams）。\n集合（set），其元素为<MATH_0017>的同构类（isomorphism classes），记为<MATH_0018>。\n参见形式形变理论（Formal Deformation Theory）的定义<REF_0005>和注记<REF_0006>。\n若<MATH_0019>为满射（surjective）且其核（kernel）局部幂零，则称元素（element）<MATH_0020>（属于<MATH_0021>）为一个<TEXTITOPEN_0001>无穷小形变（infinitesimal) deformation）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，其被形变对象是<MATH_0022>。\n在此情形下，<TEXTITOPEN_0002>由<MATH_0023>在<MATH_0024>上的无穷小自同构（infinitesimal automorphisms）构成的群（group）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>是核（kernel）\n<MATH_0025>\n注意，<MATH_0026>的一个元素（element）等同于<MATH_0027>在<MATH_0028>上的一个提升，这里所用的范畴（category）是与<MATH_0029>关联的集合（sets）纤维化范畴。\n比较形式形变理论（Formal Deformation Theory）的定义<REF_0007>以及形式形变理论（Formal Deformation Theory）的注记<REF_0008>。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n若<MATH_0030>为一个<MATH_0031>-模（module），则用<MATH_0032>表示如下<MATH_0033>-代数（algebra）：其底层<MATH_0034>-模（module）为<MATH_0035>，乘法由<MATH_0036>给出。\n当<MATH_0037>时，这就是<MATH_0038>上的对偶数环（ring），按惯例将其记为<MATH_0039>。\n存在一个<MATH_0040>-代数映射（algebra map）<MATH_0041>。\n<MATH_0042>到<MATH_0043>的拉回（pullback）称为<TEXTITOPEN_0003>平凡形变（trivial deformation）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>，它是<MATH_0044>到<MATH_0045>的形变。\n\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:b2721a434fe53e539c88c0175377eec443201b172beb9d1bb31a4c71dd093597", "unit_id": "tag:07Y6:prose-0001", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "所引用的章节名称，词表无已批准条目。", "source_term": "Formal Deformation Theory", "target_term": "形式形变理论"}, {"context": "底概形，词表无已批准条目。", "source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "底概形之上的纤维化范畴，词表无已批准条目。", "source_term": "category fibred in groupoids", "target_term": "群胚纤维化范畴"}, {"context": "代数之间的同态，词表无已批准条目。", "source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态"}, {"context": "给定同态的定义域与值域，词表无已批准条目。", "source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"context": "范畴中的对象，词表无已批准条目。", "source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"context": "提升所成的范畴及关联的纤维化范畴，词表无已批准条目。", "source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "定义提升对象的态射，词表无已批准条目。", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "由交换图定义的态射，词表无已批准条目。", "source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "提升范畴中态射的定义，词表无已批准条目。", "source_term": "commutative diagrams", "target_term": "交换图"}, {"context": "同构类所成的集合，词表无已批准条目。", "source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"context": "提升范畴的对象的同构类，词表无已批准条目。", "source_term": "isomorphism classes", "target_term": "同构类"}, {"context": "具有局部幂零核的同态的条件，词表无已批准条目。", "source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"context": "同态的核与无穷小自同构群的定义，词表无已批准条目。", "source_term": "kernel", "target_term": "核"}, {"context": "提升的同构类集合中的元素，词表无已批准条目。", "source_term": "element", "target_term": "元素"}, {"context": "具有局部幂零核的满射所对应的形变；保留提供的英文